    "name": "Kanbien Root Platform",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Postman collection for root-user authentication and the protected rootUsers feature. Public auth routes may now return 429 AUTH_THROTTLED or AUTH_LOCKED_DOWN. Protected routes may return 429 RATE_LIMITED when shared platform security middleware rejects the request. Successful root login writes a shared root session into the active Postman environment so other root-protected collections can reuse it."
  },
